\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Discussion}
\title{Recovering a cochain on a selected set of cells}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{The uncoupled Green formula in \ref{fdip-00P3} compares
pairing over a set of cells with pairing over its complement.
With links present, a contribution crossing between those
sets carries a coefficient transport. Which cells support the
resulting boundary form, and what part of a cochain can be
recovered if its first-order operator has a kernel?}
